From 10cdba7e8f8a304ede137f3a4fd06e0cd9772a36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Nov 2025 01:39:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add comprehensive marketing landing page

Added a full-featured marketing landing page with the following sections:

Landing Page Components:
- HeroSection: Compelling headline, CTAs, key benefits, and stats
- FeaturesSection: 6 feature cards highlighting core capabilities
- BenefitsSection: 4 benefit cards showing productivity improvements
- ScreenshotsSection: Visual showcase of Todo, Kanban, and Calendar
- TestimonialsSection: 6 testimonials with ratings and user stats
- FAQSection: 8 common questions with accordion UI
- CTASection: Final conversion section with gradient background
- LandingFooter: Complete footer with links and social media

Design Features:
- Fully responsive design (mobile, tablet, desktop)
- Dark mode support throughout all sections
- Smooth animations and hover effects
- Professional gradient backgrounds
- Clean, modern UI matching app design system
- Accessibility-focused with proper contrast ratios

Navigation:
- Added "Landing" link to sidebar with sparkle icon
- Separate layout for landing page (no sidebar/topbar)
- Route at /landing

SEO & Conversion:
- Clear value proposition and benefits
- Multiple CTAs throughout the page
- Trust indicators (free, privacy, offline)
- Social proof with testimonials
- Comprehensive FAQ section

All sections are fully styled with Tailwind CSS and integrate with the existing design system.
